    "description": "The Pizza Ranch Rewards app helps you use and manage your loyalty account.\r\n\r\nDownload it today for free and you\u2019ll be able to:\r\n\u2022 Sign up for a cardless loyalty account\r\n\u2022 Register a Ranch Rewards card or sign in to an existing account\r\n\u2022 Start an online order and be automatically signed in to earn points and redeem rewards\r\n\u2022 View your points and Ranch Rewards balance\r\n\u2022 Check in with a QR code or short code to earn points in-restaurant\r\n\u2022 Scan a QR code from your receipt to add missed visits to your account\r\n\u2022 Find nearby Pizza Ranch locations\r\n\u2022 Get notified of relevant offers",
